<section id="usecase">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="usecase-card">
      <span class="section-label">Use case</span>
      <h2>GraphRAG with<br /><span class="accent-gradient">Trillian + Mistral AI</span></h2>
      <p class="section-sub">
        Use Trillian as the retrieval layer in a GraphRAG pipeline. SPARQL fetches a connected,
        multi-hop subgraph to ground an answer generated by Mistral AI — with just the Python
        standard library (no API key required for retrieval).
      </p>
      <a href="https://github.com/42-grad/trillian/tree/master/examples/graphrag" class="example-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        View the tutorial
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M5 11L11 5M11 5H6m5 0v5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .usecase-card {
    padding: 3rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .usecase-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    background: var(--accent-glow);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .usecase-card .section-label,
  .usecase-card h2,
  .usecase-card p,
  .usecase-card a {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .example-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.35rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-bright);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }

  .example-link:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .usecase-card { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
  }
</style>
